{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pantry Raid is a rogue lite dungeon-crawler with cooking elements. Players traverse the pantry, defeating food-themed enemies to make meals to improve your character during the course of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-energy combat where quick reflexes and sharp strategy are key. With dynamic enemies, fluid movement, and ever-changing buff combinations, every battle is a thrilling test of skill. Dodge, strike, and adapt in the heat of the pantry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized levels and dynamic buff combinations, ensuring no two playthroughs are ever the same. Adapt to shifting strategies as new buffs reshape your play-style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each buff ties to a flavorful element\u2014like Spicy for fire attacks or Salty for ice defenses\u2014leading to unexpected synergies. Adapt, experiment, and master these dynamic power-ups to dominate the pantry!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An adorable crew of cooking critters! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582510?t=1742419875","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582510?t=1742419875","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582510/e1f5eca1dacf356fc195dad5d132c0da2bf7bdb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742419875","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582510/e1f5eca1dacf356fc195dad5d132c0da2bf7bdb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742419875","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":